<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In our 102nd episode, Lyle moves his mail, contacts, and calendar off Google and finds madness on the other side of the walled garden &#8212; Fastmail, two contact lists, a calendar his wife can&#8217;t see, Rands&#8217;s robot discovering royalties he was never paid, and why none of these services play nicely together (it&#8217;s triage, not malice).</p>



